WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:06.196
Just created your ProfCalendar account? Here is how to be ready for your first
lesson, in three steps.

2
00:00:06.648 --> 00:00:12.097
The dashboard welcomes you with a guided start. Each step is ticked off as soon as
it's done.

3
00:00:12.649 --> 00:00:18.695
Step one: your classes. A name, a subject, a colour. Add as many as you like, then
confirm.

4
00:00:19.674 --> 00:00:30.648
Step two: your weekly timetable. First, check your school's times: when lessons
start, how long periods last, the morning break and the lunch break. The preview
updates live.

5
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:37.801
Then click a period, choose the class and add the room if you like. The room is
remembered for the next periods.

6
00:00:48.998 --> 00:00:54.895
When the week is complete, confirm. This timetable repeats automatically for the
whole school year.

7
00:00:55.449 --> 00:01:04.482
Step three: choose your canton and the school year. One click on Import, and school
holidays and public holidays fall into place by themselves.

8
00:01:05.036 --> 00:01:12.788
And there you go: your calendar is ready. The week shows your lessons, period by
period, with the holidays already in place.

9
00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:18.916
Prepare your first lesson: click a period, give it a title, note the lesson flow,
then save.

10
00:01:23.793 --> 00:01:30.522
A final touch: add your students in class management, one by one, or all at once
from an Excel file.

11
00:01:31.406 --> 00:01:34.828
You're all set. Have a great school year with ProfCalendar!
